  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moringa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The market for Moringa products is growing. Moringa Wize B.V. is working with farmers in South Africa and has imported their first containers of Moringa products, including bio stimulants, moringa powder, animal feed, tea, and oil. During the project, farmers have been trained on how to farm Moringa, they received trainings on GAP certification, and have received guidance to get organically certified. Processing of the Moringa into the various products has been done on the farms themselves or third parties within South Africa. In this way all value has been added in South Africa itself and a higher price is being paid to the farmers. During the course of this TA 341 people have been trained up until now.</narrative>
  </description>
